{"id":428,"title":"解答: 带乘法的嵌套循环（高级）","summary":"详细分析了解决有乘法挑战的嵌套循环复杂度的不同方法。","tags":"","components":[{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"0933082e-4586-4f03-b0bb-728e599404d2","text":"## 参考答案","text_html":"<h2>参考答案</h2>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":0},{"type":"Code","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"fa6f9655-2337-4f72-9cc5-a63c6ea4b772","title":"","caption":"","language":"python3","special_input":"no-input","entry_file_name":"main.py","content":"n = 10  # n可为任意值\nsum = 0\npie = 3.14\nfor var in range(n):\n    j = 1\n    while j < var:\n        sum += 1\n        j *= 2\n    print(sum)\n","time_limit":30,"allow_download":false,"read_only":false,"high_lighted_lines":"","runnable":true,"judge":false,"judge_content_prepend":"\n\n\n","show_solution":false,"solution_content":"\n\n\n","additional_content":[],"hidden_code_content":{"prepend_code":"\n\n","append_code":"\n\n","code_selection":"prependCode"},"judge_content":null,"judge_hints":null,"learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"edit","step":1},{"type":"MarkdownEditor","content":{"version":"1.0","comp_id":"319407bb-9038-40f0-ad8f-b1d8a3507bff","text":"在主函数中，外循环是$O(n)$，因为它迭代`n`次。 内循环`while`迭代变量`j`，它总是 **小于** `n` 并且 `j` 每次都加倍，因此**每次内循环**至多迭代次数是 $O(log_2(n))$。 因此，上面给出的程序的总时间复杂度变为：\n\n$$O(nlog_2(n))$$\n\n下面是另一种分析方法，并得到相同的结果。\n\n因为外循环总共迭代了`n`次，其中：\n\n- 外循环第1次，则内循环迭代$O(log_2(1))$\n- 外循环第2次，则内循环迭代$O(log_2(2))$\n- ...\n- 外循环第n次，则内循环迭代$O(log_2(n))$\n\n因此，假设外循环迭代第`i`次，则内循环总共迭代$O(log_2(\\text{i}))$，故所有内循环总共迭代次数为:\n\n$$ n \\times log_2(i) \\Rightarrow\\sum_{i=1}^{n} log_2 (i)$$\n$$ \\Rightarrow log_2 (1) +... + log_2 (n-1) + log_2 (n) $$\n\n另外知道: $log(a) + log(b) = log(ab)$\n\n所以，可以变为：\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow log_2 (1 \\times 2 \\times ... \\times (n-1) \\times(n) )$$\n$$ \\Rightarrow log_2 (n!)$$\n\n因此，内循环（考虑外循环）的总时间复杂度为 $O(log_2(n!))$。 不过，我们可以用 $log_2(n))$ 替换 $log_2(1), log_2(2), log_2(3), ..., log_2(n)$ 中的每一个来简化上述求和，并得到：\n\n\n<center>\n\n> $log (n!)$ = $\\sum_{k=1}^{n} log (k)<\\sum_{k=1}^{n} log (n)$ = $nlog(n)$\n\n</center>\n\n### 时间复杂度\n\n如上面所述，程序的运行时间复杂度为：\n$$\\text {Time Complexity} = 7 + 4n + 3log_2(n!)$$\n\n\n要找到Big(O)时间复杂度:\n1. 去掉常量 $\\Rightarrow n + log_2(n!)$\n2. 去掉低阶项 $\\Rightarrow log_2(n!)$\n3. 如上所述，这可以写成 $O(n log_2(n))$。\n\n\n故复杂度是$\\Rightarrow O(n log_2(n))$。 ","text_html":"<p>在主函数中，外循环是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，因为它迭代<code>n</code>次。 内循环<code>while</code>迭代变量<code>j</code>，它总是 <strong>小于</strong> <code>n</code> 并且 <code>j</code> 每次都加倍，因此<strong>每次内循环</strong>至多迭代次数是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(log_2(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。 因此，上面给出的程序的总时间复杂度变为：</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(nlog_2(n))\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base displaystyle textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>下面是另一种分析方法，并得到相同的结果。</p>\n<p>因为外循环总共迭代了<code>n</code>次，其中：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>外循环第1次，则内循环迭代<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(log_2(1))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>外循环第2次，则内循环迭代<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(log_2(2))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>…</li>\n<li>外循环第n次，则内循环迭代<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(log_2(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>因此，假设外循环迭代第<code>i</code>次，则内循环总共迭代<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mtext><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(log_2(\\text{i}))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"text mord textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">i</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>，故所有内循环总共迭代次数为:</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>⇒</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\times log_2(i) \\Rightarrow\\sum_{i=1}^{n} log_2 (i)\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.6513970000000002em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:2.929066em;vertical-align:-1.277669em;\"></span><span class=\"base displaystyle textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:1.1776689999999999em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.000005000000000143778em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span><span class=\"op-symbol large-op mop\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-1.2500050000000003em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow log_2 (1) +... + log_2 (n-1) + log_2 (n) \n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base displaystyle textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>另外知道: <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">log(a) + log(b) = log(ab)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">a</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">b</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>所以，可以变为：</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo>×</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow log_2 (1 \\times 2 \\times ... \\times (n-1) \\times(n) )\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base displaystyle textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow log_2 (n!)\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base displaystyle textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>因此，内循环（考虑外循环）的总时间复杂度为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(log_2(n!))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。 不过，我们可以用 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">log_2(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 替换 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">log_2(1), log_2(2), log_2(3), ..., log_2(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">.</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> 中的每一个来简化上述求和，并得到：</p>\n<center>\n<blockquote>\n<p><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">log (n!)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow></msubsup><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{k=1}^{n} log (k)&lt;\\sum_{k=1}^{n} log (n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1.0500099999999999em;vertical-align:-0.30001em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"op-symbol small-op mop\" style=\"top:-0.0000050000000000050004em;\">∑</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.30001em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.364em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"op-symbol small-op mop\" style=\"top:-0.0000050000000000050004em;\">∑</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.30001em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03148em;\">k</span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-0.364em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord scriptstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span> = <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">nlog(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></p>\n</blockquote>\n</center>\n<h3>时间复杂度</h3>\n<p>如上面所述，程序的运行时间复杂度为：</p>\n<p><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text {Time Complexity} = 7 + 4n + 3log_2(n!)\n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base displaystyle textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"text mord displaystyle textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">e</span><span class=\"mord mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">x</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\" style=\"margin-right:0.01389em;\">y</span></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">7</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathrm\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p>要找到Big(O)时间复杂度:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>去掉常量 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow n + log_2(n!)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>去掉低阶项 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow log_2(n!)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">!</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>如上所述，这可以写成 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n log_2(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>故复杂度是<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>O</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Rightarrow O(n log_2(n))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.75em;\"></span><span class=\"strut bottom\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"base textstyle uncramped\"><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.02778em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.01968em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">o</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathit\" style=\"margin-right:0.03588em;\">g</span><span class=\"vlist\"><span style=\"top:0.15em;margin-right:0.05em;margin-left:-0.03588em;\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span><span class=\"reset-textstyle scriptstyle cramped\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"baseline-fix\"><span class=\"fontsize-ensurer reset-size5 size5\"><span style=\"font-size:0em;\">​</span></span>​</span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathit\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span>。</p>\n","learn_status":"undo"},"mode":"view","step":2}],"status":"undo","course_no":"010","source_url":"https://edu.py2fun.com/api/course/010/page/428"}
